<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">FLM ARUM</book>
  <para style="h">FILIMON</para>
  <para style="toc1">Filimon</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filimon</para>
  <para style="toc3">Flm</para>
  <para style="mt2">AMGBASHO BULUS A NA NA</para>
  <para style="mt1">FILIMON</para>
  <para style="imt">IKPI TSIFA</para>
  <para style="im">Filimon tana bu kyangwri tufa alindeh.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Anyi na amya Ablusu, mya meh nza ni bu ma ida ka tsifa Yeso Kristi, tasa za atsi ambohroh Timoti,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHM 1:1">A na na Filimon iza ndohmoh ambohroh ata mbohroh nza meh kira na a ŋoh reh, <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />tasa Apiya asra ambohroh tasa Arkibusu atsi ambohroh nimeh shi wuwana, tasa za a na ma kyangwri amboh tufa Yeso amboh ata nza maka a dohsohna ma afiya anzoh<verse eid="PHM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Lisa alindeh ta a bu na amohnoh tasa tuma alindeh nyi na Nnoh Ada ambohroh tasa Ada Yeso Kristi.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngǝnga kwere Tasa Kwere Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />Atsimya Filimon, meh kǝ kwende Nnoh amya na tutu nza meh kǝ kohnoh na amohnoh nimeh kwere Nnoh amya, <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />tsifa la meh sehreh tsifa ma ikpi nga agohsoh amohnoh nimeh Ada Yeso tasa kira amohnoh ma amboh zanana mboh reh nambri. <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />Meh kwere Nnoh la ti de lisa alindeh gaga ba, ata nza anyi na nga agohsoh anzoh, wohroh za a nati a de noh ti bu na lomo wina awumu alilehndeh mboh nambri ata nza meh bu na wohroh nimeh Kristi reh. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Atsimya, kira anzoh reh a de nana agohsoh a ba meh gaga tasa wuwana agohsoh gaga tsifa la agohsoh amboh zanana maa a hunji wuwa agohsoh anyi na anzoh.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ablusu a kwere tsifa Onisimus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Tsifa la tswanza nza ni kǝ kira na amboh tufa Kristi mboh reh, meh nati wuwa agohsoh nimeh Kristi meh ti nga nnoh aniye la ti lisa andromboh ata nza na a tswa ti lisa reh, <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />Neh a bu tsifa la meh kira na amohnoh. Mya Ablusu meh keh kira meh ti kwere nnoh, mya nza meh te achoh nehnehreh na meh bu ma ida ka tsifa Kristi Yeso. <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />Meh kwere aniye na amehreh amya Onisimus, ata nza a bu tswanza a bu ada na amya na ameh ata meh bu ma ida ka tasa za meh bu tswanza Ada. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />Na amehmeh tana a bu kyangwri alindeh kpeh, nehnehreh neh kǝ gyuruna bu kyangwri alindeh ma nambri ma ambohroh, nnoh tasa ma mya.<verse eid="PHM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />Meh buti tohmoh ŋoh nehnehreh ta a gyuru a ba na anzoh, ŋoh ata agohsoh amya nambri nza a gu ma ikpi a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Mya nza bu ma ida ka ma ikpi tsifa nana reh, meh keh kira meh ti gya ŋoh na amya la ta ka a shingi meh ndohmoh tsifa nana reh aniye anzoh. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Neh meh kira meh ti de noh na wuwana la ti shingi meh kpeh, mya meh kira la ti lisa na agohsoh anzoh anyimbehreh, mya meh nati lisa andromboh kpeh, nza noh ni kira feh. <verse eid="PHM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Handuhwa Onisimus reh ata nnoh ma ameh shidi ma, la ti gyuru sa ŋoh ta tuma atono na anzoh. <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />Ni nati sa ŋoh tswanza ahwra na anzoh za kpeh, neh ti sa ŋoh tswanza ata nza a keh ahwra, wohroh reh la ti sa ŋoh tswanza a bu atsi anzoh ata nza ma a kira reh. Meh kira na a ŋoh gaga neh la ta a bu noh, ni nati kira na a ŋoh keh dehreh, tsifa la ni bu ahwra tasa za ata nza a nga agohsoh ma Ada fiya.<verse eid="PHM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Nza a bu dehreh nza mya bu iza ndohmoh na anzoh, sa ŋoh tswanza nza ni nati sa meh. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Nza Onisimus a lisa nnoh andromboh abibi, ha a de noh kohfoh, bleh were meh ma ikpi amya. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />Mya, Ablusu, meh buti ŋa amgbasho ata areh na ivoh amya la meh nati fanga nnoh yama, andromboh ata ŋoh nza a tufa nnoh, meh nati bleh kpeh la meh tufa nnoh kohfoh fene anzoh. <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />a bu tsifa wohroh, atsi mya meh kwere nnoh ti lisa meh alindeh ata areh tsifa Ada. Nga meh nana agohsoh nimeh Kristi! <verse eid="PHM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />Meh wina ma agohsoh amya tsifa kuku ikpi amohnoh, meh ŋa ba nnoh, meh wina la ni nati lisa nnoh ata nza a keh ata mya nza meh luhu. <verse eid="PHM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />A treh a hwa andromboh anyimbehreh: Lisa meh noh ida leh tamba sehneh mboh, meh wina ni kǝ kwere nnoh ma ikpi mya la Nnoh ta a gyuru a de meh a ba na amohnoh yama.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsifa Na Amohnoh Ata Trinaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Abafara, iza ida ka amya nimeh Kristi Yeso, la ŋoh atsifa na amohnoh, <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />tasa ziza amya mboh; Markus, tasa Aristarku, tasa Demas, tasa za Luka amboh ata areh nambri ma amoh atohngoh ambohroh ma atsi ndohmoh, mboh za la tama atsifa na amohnoh. <verse eid="PHM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Lisa alindeh ata Ada Yeso Kristi ta bu na huru amohnoh.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>